{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "執", "id": "執"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "學", "id": "學"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "射", "id": "射"}, {"form": "弓", "id": "弓"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "望", "id": "望"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "生", "id": "生"}, {"form": "良人", "id": "良人"}, {"form": "責", "id": "責"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}, {"form": "酒", "id": "酒"}, {"form": "饜", "id": "饜"}, {"form": "鬭", "id": "鬭"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7615456906315583, "source": "酒", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.0980179272527715, "source": "酒", "target": "反"}, {"weight": 2.321161478566981, "source": "酒", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 3.3019907315787074, "source": "酒", "target": "饜"}, {"weight": 3.484312288372662, "source": "執", "target": "弓"}, {"weight": 1.8748743759385615, "source": "執", "target": "夫子"}, {"weight": 3.484312288372662, "source": "射", "target": "學"}, {"weight": 1.8748743759385615, "source": "射", "target": "夫子"}, {"weight": 2.4546928711915035, "source": "同", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.309560566888501, "source": "同", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.608843551018762, "source": "同", "target": "室"}, {"weight": 3.0143086591269266, "source": "同", "target": "鬭"}, {"weight": 0.9040954587803368, "source": "王", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.3019907315787074, "source": "王", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 2.